Subject: [PATCH 17/21] MERGE-8b5a91b5: laptop packages 3..59 (GitLab main
 db6736c5..8b5a91b5, GitHub HPI-Jimmy-Chiu/HT9050 1d25eb6..d2f400b) applied to
 the machine tree
MIME-Version: 1.0
Content-Type: text/plain; charset=UTF-8
Content-Transfer-Encoding: 8bit

EastSun 20260928: "現在是否為GITHUB上最新版本同步? ... 你做完上述落後，編譯成功就讓我測試" and "切記不要輕易更動到機台測試回饋問題
已經被修正的部分". GitHub main had moved cf15bbe -> d2f400b: packages 3..59 of the laptop (package 2 is replaced by 3).

How: one cumulative pass instead of 57 sequential ones, with the packages' own rules (check_and_copy.ps1):
laptop = the file from the LAST package that carries it, known = package 59's known_versions.tsv (every laptop version,
all refs), base = the latest machine git version the laptop knows. Union 573 files:
  SAME 68 | NEW 224 copied | OLD 276 replaced (machine copy was a laptop version, i.e. unchanged here) | LOCAL 5 three-way
  merged (git merge-file), all clean, each reviewed by hand | GONE 8 (see below).
LOCAL (machine fixes kept, laptop changes added on top; laptop->merged == base->machine for each file):
  cinitial.cpp                  TEMP-DOORS / TEMP-DOORS-2 kept (base 261c25d); + laptop PLC-GATES (W7a-I3 #if 1), R82 comment fixes
  tools/wb_serve.cpp            WSFANOUT maxConnections 64 kept (base 261c25d); + laptop ModalWaitTick (1203 Poll during blocking
                                dialogs, tower light / buzzer), TesterComm poll, ELA, busy de-bounce, ... (+459/-69)
  WebBridge/WebBridgeServer.cpp WSFANOUT shared lastSent + TAKEOVER kept (base 261c25d); + laptop CONNID, MODAL-WAKE,
                                Q2 read-only exemptions (contactct.get / counterclear.get / observer.get)
  (web: ht9045_io_do.js, ht9045_recipe_client.js -- separate web commit)
Check that the machine's fixes survived the 276 replaced files: every line carrying a machine work tag (MT-E*, MT-FIX1*,
IOWEB-P*, ONSITE-1, LAT-1, MERGE-56bbf785, TEMP-DOORS*, WSFANOUT, TAKEOVER, 1203COLD-*) in the machine copy was looked up in the
laptop's final copy: 16 files carry such lines, 1 line differs -- csystem.cpp's MT-E3b note on G03, which the laptop rewrote as
"SUPERSEDED" (comment only, the code is identical). The laptop had merged the machine's 20494aea in package 5.
GONE: the 8 files main deleted (FileRW/TestIF_File.cpp, JsonBridge/gen/form_*.gen.cpp x5, tests/test_formbridge_testerif.cpp,
tools/gen_formjson.py) are left on disk and NOT deleted by this commit (deletion was refused here); no CMakeLists refers to
them any more, so nothing builds them.
Before applying: backup of system / config / IniData / Error / HT9045_Log / GPIB9045\system in
D:\HT9045\_BACKUP_20260928_pre_pkg59 (file counts equal). No wb_serve was running.
Build: build_integ_ship_x86 --target wb_serve exit 0 (full rebuild); pe_truncation_check 178 exe/dll complete. ctest not run.
Behaviour the packages bring to this machine (INDEX_SUCKER_TYPE=1, USE_ATC_MODE=5, IO_CARD_TYPE=4) -- see the package README
table: boot sets the Loader/Empty/Color lift + Auto table state machines to 1 (pkg 59), UpdateMainOperateMode switches heater
relays / sends ATC commands / writes lastdata + config.ini (pkg 14), the tester-comm engine thread starts (pkg 8,
HT9045_TESTERCOMM=0 stops it), ELA writes missing config.ini / Gerneral.ini Machine ID keys (pkg 33, HT9045_ELA=0), logs go to
D:\HT9045_Log (pkg 21...), INDEX_SUCKER_TYPE=1 is now read (pkg 48: Index Check waits for both nozzle rows' vacuum), the Z
safety interlocks are real (pkg 50), the out-arm really picks and places (pkg 51), Index position errors stop all motors and
single-axis home really moves (pkg 53).

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>
