+   - `this->Handle` → `HandlerWndToken()`
+   - `&HGpib2Handler->iCommand=(unsigned int *)P->lpData;` → `HGpib2Handler = reinterpret_cast<VM*>(P->lpData);` (HGpib2Handler is the global `VM*`)
